## Remarks

- The test suite currently tests the [Add](List.Add.md), [Remove](List.Remove.md), [Insert](List.Insert.md), [Set](List.Set.md), [Get](List.Item.md), [Contains](List.Contains.md), [Clear](List.Clear.md), and [RemoveAt](List.RemoveAt.md) methods of the ArrayList class.

- Each test method executes the [ArrayList](List.md) methods under test using the provided inputs, then checks certain conditions to confirm the [ArrayList](List.md) has not been altered in unexpected ways. 

- Condition checks are performed with a few simple assertions. The method execution order is also guaranteed by the framework. The order of these assertions is also preserved when the test is run. 

- Test suite is also checking for the [precondition](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn842962.aspx) and [postcondition](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn842960.aspx) of these ArrayList methods. 

